# Authored in OSRS journal style from the OSRS Wiki walkthrough (no Wiki journal transcript); stages pinned to the server's quest states.
before	<col=000080>I can start this quest by talking to <col=800000>Wizard Persten</col> north of <col=800000>Al Kharid</col>, near the gate from <col=800000>Lumbridge</col>.</col>
