step	1	10	After starting the quest
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Wizard Persten</col> lent me an <col=800000>Eye amulet</col>. She wants me to show it to the <col=800000>Mage of Zamorak</col> in <col=800000>Varrock</col>.</col>
step	2	20	After showing the amulet
line	<str>Wizard Persten lent me an Eye amulet.</str>
line	<col=000080>The <col=800000>Mage of Zamorak</col> looked at the amulet. He wants a strong cup of tea from the <col=800000>Tea Seller</col> before he'll help.</col>
step	3	40	After entering the Abyss
line	<str>Wizard Persten lent me an Eye amulet.</str>
line	<str>The Mage of Zamorak looked at the amulet.</str>
line	<col=000080>The <col=800000>Mage of Zamorak</col> drank the tea and teleported me into the <col=800000>Abyss</col>. I should find the <col=800000>Dark Mage</col>.</col>
step	4	50	After raising the energies
line	<str>Wizard Persten lent me an Eye amulet.</str>
line	<str>The Mage of Zamorak looked at the amulet.</str>
line	<str>The Mage of Zamorak drank the tea and teleported me into the Abyss.</str>
line	<col=000080>I used a bucket of water and the amulet near the <col=800000>Dark Mage</col> and six runic energies appeared. I should touch each of them.</col>
step	5	60	After getting the incantation
line	<str>Wizard Persten lent me an Eye amulet.</str>
line	<str>The Mage of Zamorak looked at the amulet.</str>
line	<str>The Mage of Zamorak drank the tea and teleported me into the Abyss.</str>
line	<str>I used a bucket of water and the amulet near the Dark Mage and six runic energies appeared.</str>
line	<col=000080>The <col=800000>Dark Mage</col> gave me an abyssal incantation. I should take it to <col=800000>Wizard Persten</col>.</col>
step	6	62	After returning to Persten
line	<str>Wizard Persten lent me an Eye amulet.</str>
line	<str>The Mage of Zamorak looked at the amulet.</str>
line	<str>The Mage of Zamorak drank the tea and teleported me into the Abyss.</str>
line	<str>I used a bucket of water and the amulet near the Dark Mage and six runic energies appeared.</str>
line	<str>The Dark Mage gave me an abyssal incantation.</str>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Wizard Persten</col> copied the incantation and teleported me to the <col=800000>Wizards' Tower</col>. I should take it to <col=800000>Archmage Sedridor</col>.</col>
step	7	70	After speaking to Sedridor
line	<str>Wizard Persten lent me an Eye amulet.</str>
line	<str>The Mage of Zamorak looked at the amulet.</str>
line	<str>The Mage of Zamorak drank the tea and teleported me into the Abyss.</str>
line	<str>I used a bucket of water and the amulet near the Dark Mage and six runic energies appeared.</str>
line	<str>The Dark Mage gave me an abyssal incantation.</str>
line	<str>Wizard Persten copied the incantation and teleported me to the Wizards' Tower.</str>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Archmage Sedridor</col> took the incantation. <col=800000>Wizard Traiborn</col> needs help with his apprentices' riddles.</col>
step	8	80	After solving the riddle
line	<str>Wizard Persten lent me an Eye amulet.</str>
line	<str>The Mage of Zamorak looked at the amulet.</str>
line	<str>The Mage of Zamorak drank the tea and teleported me into the Abyss.</str>
line	<str>I used a bucket of water and the amulet near the Dark Mage and six runic energies appeared.</str>
