line	<str>Wizard Persten copied the incantation and teleported me to the Wizards' Tower.</str>
line	<str>Archmage Sedridor took the incantation.</str>
line	<col=000080>I solved the apprentices' riddle. I should go back to <col=800000>Archmage Sedridor</col>.</col>
